  "title": "WSLua: CaptureInfoConst attributes use wdh->shb_hdrs",
  "description": "The comment, hardware, os, and user_app attribute getters dereferenced\nwth->shb_hdrs, but push_CaptureInfoConst() always sets wth to NULL.\nAccessing any of these from a write FileHandler script crashed.\n\nSwitch them to wdh->shb_hdrs, which is the section header blocks field\non wtap_dumper.\n\nAI-Assisted: yes (Claude)",
